	(descr "Mini-DIN 4 (S-video) right-angle PCB jack, CUI / Same Sky MD-40SM, 'date codes prior to 03/03/2022' PCB layout from the MD-SM series datasheet rev 1.09 (4x 1.0 mm pins at +-3.25 mm in two rows 8.5 and 11 mm from the edge, 2x 2.5 mm shield posts at +-6.7 mm, 2.5x1.0 mm shield tab slot). Origin = board edge mid-point, opening faces +Y, body extends to -Y. Pins seen from the top: 1 right/front, 2 left/front, 3 right/rear, 4 left/rear (S-video: 1 GND-Y, 2 GND-C, 3 Y, 4 C).")
